  {
    "id": "moment_008",
    "title": "Words of love",
    "date": "2023-02-22",
    "timestamp": "February 21, 2023",
    "messages": [
      {
        "fromMe": false,
        "text": "I love you babe and I don’t doubt we will be good. This is just a rough time for us both but I know for sure we will overcome it because we have each other. I do feel like there are multiple perspectives on what’s been bothering you that I’ve not heard probably because I’ve been sick these past days and I haven’t been in the best position to talk. However, I’m ever ready to listen to you and be of help. We can always talk about things and we are still a work in progress. We will for sure get better. Bad days are not enough to break us. When I say I love you unconditionally I mean it, unconditionally also means the days we are not at our best. I know you love me and I love me and as such I know for sure there is nothing we can’t get through hand in hand, together. ♥️♥️",
        "time": "9:26 AM"
      }
    ],
    "image": null,
