        "text": "I love you with everything in me and so help me God I will never make you feel like you felt in the past. I promise to be better understanding. This morning really opened my eyes to the other side of your struggles and I’m so so sorry I didn’t address this earlier. Baby your feelings will always be valid. Your emotions will always be valid. I want to hear them. I want to understand them. I don’t care how long it’s been. This is not a short term thing for me. You are my future and my forever. ♥️",
        "time": "11:02 AM"
      }
    ],
